{"role": "user", "text": "**0:00–0:25**：手机拍 K7、摄像头、云台、喇叭；  这些了，怎么拍切到串口显示启动日志、`nsh>` 和只读命令  \n", "ts": "2026-09-19T08:13:00.422Z", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "metadata": {"source_line": 95264, "source_record_sha256": "bb524824d212fcbde4fa3ce8938195a2673170231bf704b6b3021ce47bd2cfd4"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 39451}
{"role": "assistant", "text": "有两种拍法，推荐第二种。\n\n**方法一：手机一镜到底**\n\n1. 手机先对准 K7、摄像头、云台和喇叭，拍 5 秒。\n2. 缓慢把镜头移到电脑屏幕。\n3. 电脑上提前打开串口终端，显示：\n   ```text\n   U-Boot ...\n   NuttShell (NSH)\n   nsh>\n   ```\n4. 在 `nsh>` 后输入只读命令：\n   ```sh\n   k7radio provision-status\n   ```\n5. 拍到输出后再切回设备画面。\n\n口述可以说：\n\n> “这是运行在 K7 上的 openvela 系统，串口已经进入 NSH。下面查询无线服务状态。”\n\n**方法二：OBS 分开录制，成片更清楚**\n\n- OBS 录制 Ubuntu 桌面，只包含串口终端和联调窗口。\n- 手机单独拍 K7 实物。\n- 后期先放 5 秒设备画面，再切到串口画面，最后回到设备画面。\n\n串口终端可以提前打开：\n\n```bash\npicocom -b 1500000 /dev/ttyUSB0\n```\n\n或者：\n\n```bash\nscreen /dev/ttyUSB0 1500000\n```\n\n看到 `nsh>` 后只输入：\n\n```sh\nk7radio provision-status\n```\n\n这个命令只查询状态，不会重启或驱动云台。拍摄时不要让串口终端显示密码、token 或 API Key。", "ts": "2026-09-19T08:13:14.656Z", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "metadata": {"source_line": 95269, "source_record_sha256": "15b9bbe4bc242ae087ef5e8dfc76cf1e4414a18b23592da151de131193f90c50"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 39452}
