{"role": "assistant", "text": "这是因为联调窗口正在占用 `/dev/ttyUSB0`，不是串口坏了。\n\n先查占用进程：\n\n```bash\npgrep -af integration_panel.py\n```\n\n结束联调窗口进程：\n\n```bash\nkill <上一步显示的PID>\n```\n\n然后重新打开串口：\n\n```bash\npicocom -b 1500000 /dev/ttyUSB0\n```\n\n看到 `nsh>` 后输入只读命令：\n\n```sh\nk7radio provision-status\n```\n\n录完串口画面后，再重新启动联调窗口：\n\n```bash\ncd ~/openvela/work/velavision-project\npython3 host/whole_device/integration_panel.py --connect\n```\n\n不要同时运行 `picocom` 和联调窗口，否则它们会再次争用串口。", "ts": "2026-09-19T08:14:26.049Z", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "metadata": {"source_line": 95281, "source_record_sha256": "6af9fa5bea6ed999bb413915a105fb740367bccb8dec950623f1130708d080c4"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 39455}
