{"role": "assistant", "text": "这个固件里的 `voicecam 1800` 任务没有可用的正常取消入口，`device-stop` 和 `halt` 都不会结束相机线程，所以我不再让你反复尝试。为了今天直接录视频，我给串口加一个“录制模式”：只过滤 `TRACK` 调试行，NSH 提示符和你输入的命令仍保留，板端功能不改。", "ts": "2026-09-19T08:26:18.071Z", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "metadata": {"source_line": 95444, "source_record_sha256": "c19053dfdfc1f36c9a48dea82caba0487f4029eeb255e0f87b79c6fc281d7d8d"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 39512}
{"role": "tool", "tool_name": "exec", "tool_call_id": "call_Y7toFWpZYqgjLhnnDr0euwi6", "input": "const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"$ssh='C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\OpenSSH\\\\ssh.exe'; $key='C:\\\\Users\\\\pc2025\\\\Documents\\\\Codex\\\\2026-09-03\\\\new-chat\\\\work\\\\ssh\\\\ubuntu_vm_pc2025_ed25519'; $kh='C:\\\\Users\\\\pc2025\\\\Documents\\\\Codex\\\\2026-09-03\\\\new-chat\\\\work\\\\ssh\\\\known_hosts'; $script=@'\\nimport os, re, select, sys, time\\nimport serial\\ns=serial.Serial('/dev/ttyUSB0', 1500000, timeout=0.03, write_timeout=2, exclusive=True)\\ntrack=re.compile(rb'(?m)^TRACK q=.*?(?:\\\\r?\\\\n|$)')\\ntry:\\n    s.write(b'\\\\r'); s.flush()\\n    while True:\\n        if select.select([sys.stdin], [], [], 0.02)[0]:\\n            data=os.read(sys.stdin.fileno(), 4096)\\n            if not data: break\\n            s.write(data); s.flush()\\n        data=s.read(8192)\\n        if data:\\n            data=track.sub(b'', data)\\n            if data:\\n                sys.stdout.buffer.write(data); sys.stdout.buffer.flush()\\nfinally:\\n    s.close()\\n'@; $b64=[Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes($script)); $cmd=\\\"echo $b64 | base64 -d > /home/swl/nsh-record-console.py && chmod 700 /home/swl/nsh-record-console.py\\\"; & $ssh -i $key -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=10 -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes -o UserKnownHostsFile=$kh swl@[development LAN IP] $cmd\",\"workdir\":\"E:\\\\openvela\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":2000,\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"在 Ubuntu 创建仅过滤 TRACK 调试行的串口录制脚本，保留 NSH 输入输出，便于用户录制演示而不改板端功能。\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\OpenSSH\\\\ssh.exe\"]});\ntext(r.output);\n", "ts": "2026-09-19T08:26:27.147Z", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "metadata": {"source_line": 95445, "source_record_sha256": "aaf35c274f7d00f8eb31fe3532e125b27977a171f0414b11f079f0ab04747ed7"}, "redacted_count": 1, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb