{"role": "assistant", "text": "已经处理好了。串口的 `picocom` 已释放，我在 Ubuntu 创建了录制专用串口脚本，会自动隐藏连续的 `TRACK` 调试行，但保留 `nsh>`、启动日志和命令输出。\n\n在 Ubuntu 终端运行：\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/nsh-record-console.py\n```\n\n然后按回车，应该能看到干净的：\n\n```text\nnsh>\n```\n\n接着输入：\n\n```sh\nk7radio provision-status\n```\n\n这个窗口就可以直接录视频了。录完按 `Ctrl+C` 退出脚本；它只过滤显示内容，没有修改板端功能。", "ts": "2026-09-19T08:26:40.182Z", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "metadata": {"source_line": 95453, "source_record_sha256": "078a927d73d3cf9381692377f443da221a6936c8121fdd037f44691d8672ba56"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 39516}
