{"role": "assistant", "text": "现在已经恢复到可录制状态：\n\n- 稳定版已重新回载\n- `nsh>` 应该可以正常出现\n- 串口没有被其他程序占用\n- eMMC 未写入\n\n请在 Ubuntu 运行：\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/nsh-record-console.py\n```\n\n看到 `nsh>` 后输入：\n\n```sh\nk7radio provision-status\n```\n\n先完成“硬件 + NSH 启动证据”这一段。", "ts": "2026-09-19T09:31:23.761Z", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "metadata": {"source_line": 95820, "source_record_sha256": "598fb5e60d57ebe250d65569f2a9f744de5807028663e5025bcbac3de2b78e3b"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 39644}
