progressive), 960x544, q=2-31, 1200 kb/s, 30 fps, 15360 tbn\r\n    Metadata:\r\n      encoder         : Lavc60.3.100 libopenh264\r\n    Side data:\r\n      cpb: bitrate max/min/avg: 1200000/0/1200000 buffer size: 0 vbv_delay: N/A\r\n  Stream #0:1: Audio: aac (LC) (mp4a / 0x6134706D), 48000 Hz, stereo, fltp, 192 kb/s\r\n    Metadata:\r\n      encoder         : Lavc60.3.100 aac\r\nframe=    0 fps=0.0 q=-0.0 size=       0kB time=00:00:00.00 bitrate=N/A speed=   0x    \rframe=  233 fps=0.0 q=-0.0 size=    1280kB time=00:00:07.76 bitrate=1350.1kbits/s speed=15.3x    \rframe=  503 fps=499 q=-0.0 size=    2816kB time=00:00:16.77 bitrate=1375.3kbits/s dup=1 drop=0 speed=16.7x    \rframe=  821 fps=545 q=-0.0 size=    4352kB time=00:00:27.37 bitrate=1302.4kbits/s dup=1 drop=0 speed=18.2x    \rframe= 1152 fps=574 q=-0.0 size=    6400kB time=00:00:38.40 bitrate=1365.1kbits/s dup=2 drop=0 speed=19.1x    \rframe= 1393 fps=555 q=-0.0 size=    7680kB time=00:00:46.42 bitrate=1355.3kbits/s dup=3 drop=0 speed=18.5x    \rframe= 1602 fps=532 q=-0.0 size=    8960kB time=00:00:53.39 bitrate=1374.8kbits/s dup=3 drop=0 speed=17.7x    \rframe= 1844 fps=525 q=-0.0 size=   10240kB time=00:01:01.46 bitrate=1364.9kbits/s dup=3 drop=0 speed=17.5x    \rframe= 2081 fps=519 q=-0.0 size=   11520kB time=00:01:09.38 bitrate=1360.2kbits/s dup=3 drop=0 speed=17.3x    \rframe= 2327 fps=516 q=-0.0 size=   13056kB time=00:01:17.57 bitrate=1378.7kbits/s dup=3 drop=0 speed=17.2x    \rframe= 2558 fps=510 q=-0.0 size=   14336kB time=00:01:25.26 bitrate=1377.4kbits/s dup=5 drop=0 speed=  17x    \rframe= 2841 fps=515 q=-0.0 size=   15872kB time=00:01:34.70 bitrate=1372.9kbits/s dup=6 drop=0 speed=17.2x    \rframe= 3118 fps=519 q=-0.0 size=   17408kB time=00:01:43.93 bitrate=1372.0kbits/s dup=6 drop=0 speed=17.3x    \rframe= 3372 fps=518 q=-0.0 size=   18688kB time=00:01:52.41 bitrate=1361.9kbits/s dup=8 drop=0 speed=17.3x    \rframe= 3611 fps=515 q=-0.0 size=   20224kB time=00:02:00.37 bitrate=1376.3kbits/s dup=