{"role": "assistant", "text": "先不要断电。\n\n这次云端适配改的是 Ubuntu 主机网关和联调窗口，程序被关掉不会影响板端固件。现在先在 Ubuntu 终端重新启动：\n\n```bash\ncd ~/openvela/work/velavision-project\nmkdir -p evidence/integration-panel-20260916\nnohup python3 host/whole_device/integration_panel.py \\\n  --output evidence/integration-panel-20260916 \\\n  --connect \\\n  > evidence/integration-panel-20260916/window-console.log 2>&1 &\n```\n\n如果窗口启动后仍然没有视频流、串口无回应或板端状态卡住，再断电约 5 秒后重新上电。", "ts": "2026-09-19T11:53:39.616Z", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata": {"source_line": 96822, "source_record_sha256": "d6a394d2f4b40ffa0a966027d90fa992f2ad0a9e1416670a7058a7d94bce8a96"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 39997}
