{"role": "assistant", "text": "断电后视频流消失有一个关键原因：之前运行的是 RAM 加载的整机固件，断电会把它清掉，板子会回到基础启动状态。云端代码没有导致视频流消失。现在要先把相机整机固件重新加载，再启动联调窗口。", "ts": "2026-09-19T11:57:31.663Z", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata": {"source_line": 96834, "source_record_sha256": "596e7d68faaa1507464ccb04eac6a45e0082417874480b8be31323c148aebb37"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a07ed4-3f0d-7450-8bb1-bb756849cb4e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 40000}
